sequenceDiagram
    %% id: read-seq
    participant app
    participant kernel
    participant cache as page cache
    participant disk
    app->>kernel: read(fd, buf, n)
    kernel->>cache: filemap_get_folio
    alt hit
        cache-->>kernel: folio
    else miss
        kernel->>cache: filemap_add_folio
        kernel->>disk: submit_bio
        disk-->>kernel: completion IRQ
    end
    Note over kernel: copy_to_user
    kernel-->>app: bytes read
